**/*_reference_audit.md
**/*_note.md

# Copyrighted source material - NEVER publish (textbook PDFs, FLW authors' BIO 226 slides)
book/
author_slides/

# RAG index is large (~117M) and fully rebuildable from the local corpus; code is tracked, data is not
rag/data/
rag/.venv/
.venv/

